 sehr ehrenvolle Aktion von ihm, Respekt dafür.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Gruß<br>Nachtfrische</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":72769,"threadID":4853,"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","subject":"","time":1508187045,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":9,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1508187523,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1508188247,"value":1},{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1508192298,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1508192899,"value":1},{"userID":2543,"username":"Skittles","time":1508194807,"value":1},{"userID":2368,"username":"Zelimirus","time":1508233684,"value":1},{"userID":2556,"username":"kRAYZN","time":1508246441,"value":1},{"userID":2611,"username":"FantasyGamer29","time":1508253609,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1508261152,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Thanks for kind words. But you have not won rule breakers, I will still be there to stop you, it just won&#x27;t be that often...</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":72771,"threadID":4853,"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","subject":"","time":1508187171,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2611,"username":"FantasyGamer29","time":1508253624,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>I know why this happened because <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2335-thorin-pikachu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Thorin Pikachu</a> told me in teamspeak so I just want to say that I have a lot of respect for the people like you <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2335-thorin-pikachu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Thorin Pikachu</a> who knows when the decisions have to be made.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":72773,"threadID":4853,"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","subject":"","time":1508187431,"last